patchman-client (4.0.8-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of unified patchman-client package
  * Includes bash, python, and go implementations
  * Uses update-alternatives for switching implementations
  * Adds package manager hooks (apt, dnf, yum, zypper, pacman, portage)

